{"cells":[{"cell_type":"markdown","id":"b5112f88","metadata":{"id":"b5112f88"},"source":["# 用語集をLoRAで学習し、学習前後を比較する\n","\n","Driveに保存済みのtrain.jsonl（464件）、valid.jsonl（58件）、test.jsonl（58件）、gold.jsonを使い、通常の文章による用語説明を学習します。\n","\n","モデルはQwen/Qwen3.5-0.8B、量子化なしのLoRAです。今回は20エポック・1,160ステップを基盤モデルから学習します。各エポックで検証し、検証損失が最小のモデルを最終評価します。前回の3エポックの結果は残します。\n","\n","学習前後の58問を必須語句の一致率で比較します。これは簡易指標なので、生成文と正解文を読み比べて意味的な正確性も確認してください。\n","\n","入力データ、チェックポイント、学習済みadapter、評価結果はDriveに保存します。学習実行中に設定やモデル読み込みセルを再実行しないでください。"]},{"cell_type":"markdown","id":"98a33c9e","metadata":{"id":"98a33c9e"},"source":["## 0. 環境の確認とライブラリの導入\n","\n","**やること**: GPU が割り当てられているかを確認し、ライブラリを動作確認済みの版に固定して導入します。\n","\n","**見るところ**\n","\n","- 1 つ目のセルに `Tesla T4` と表示されること。\n","- 2 つ目のセルの最後に、版の一覧（`transformers: 5.18.0` など）が表示されること。導入は 1 分ほどかかります。\n","\n","**うまくいかないとき**\n","\n","- 「GPU が見つかりません」と出る: メニューの「ランタイム」→「ランタイムのタイプを変更」→「T4 GPU」を選び、セルを実行し直します。混雑で割り当てられないときは、時間をおいて試します。\n","- pip の赤い `ERROR: pip's dependency resolver ...`（`cudf` や `pyarrow` に関するもの）は、Colab に最初から入っている別のパッケージとの食い違いの警告です。この演習には影響しないので、そのまま進めます。"]},{"cell_type":"code","execution_count":null,"id":"dadb3b96","metadata":{"id":"dadb3b96","colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/"},"executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1793279986081,"user_tz":-540,"elapsed":93,"user":{"displayName":"松浦健太","userId":"07161653785768738821"}},"outputId":"331ce293-6aef-4ee7-e562-eb413b12d83d"},"outputs":[{"output_type":"stream","name":"stdout","text":["name, memory.total [MiB]\n","Tesla T4, 15360 MiB\n","\n"]}],"source":["import subprocess\n","try:\n","    gpu_info = subprocess.run([\"nvidia-smi\", \"--query-gpu=name,memory.total\", \"--format=csv\"], capture_output=True, text=True).stdout\n","except FileNotFoundError:   # CPU ランタイムには nvidia-smi が無い\n","    gpu_info = \"\"\n","print(gpu_info or \"GPU が見つかりません。ランタイム → ランタイムのタイプを変更 → T4 GPU を選んでください。\")"]},{"cell_type":"code","execution_count":null,"id":"4d946a72","metadata":{"id":"4d946a72","colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/"},"executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1793412972209,"user_tz":-540,"elapsed":17321,"user":{"displayName":"松浦健太","userId":"07161653785768738821"}},"outputId":"a69799e8-8545-4a39-efcc-f89f15c4e42e"},"outputs":[{"output_type":"stream","name":"stdout","text":["\u001b[33mWARNING: Skipping torchao as it is not installed.\u001b[0m\u001b[33m\n","\u001b[0m{'transformers': '5.18.0', 'peft': '0.21.1', 'trl': '1.14.2', 'accelerate': '1.15.0', 'datasets': '5.1.0', 'torch': '2.11.0+cu130'}\n"]}],"source":["# Colab の T4（Python 3.13、torch 2.11.0+cu130）で動作確認した版。torch は Colab 同梱のものをそのまま使う\n","PINS = {\n","    \"transformers\": \"5.18.0\",   # Qwen3.5 は transformers 5 系が必要\n","    \"peft\": \"0.21.1\",           # LoRA の実装\n","    \"trl\": \"1.14.2\",            # 学習ループ（SFTTrainer）\n","    \"accelerate\": \"1.15.0\",\n","    \"datasets\": \"5.1.0\",\n","}\n","spec = \" \".join(f'\"{k}=={v}\"' for k, v in PINS.items())\n","%pip uninstall -y -q torchao   # Colab 同梱の torchao（0.10）は peft 0.21 と非互換で、学習時に ImportError になる。使わないので外す\n","%pip install -q {spec}\n","\n","# cudf-cu13 と pyarrow の依存警告が ERROR 表示されるが、cudf は使わないので無視してよい\n","import transformers, peft, trl, accelerate, datasets, torch\n","print({m.__name__: m.__version__ for m in [transformers, peft, trl, accelerate, datasets, torch]})"]},{"cell_type":"markdown","id":"bc7243bd","metadata":{"id":"bc7243bd"},"source":["## 1. 設定とDriveへの保存\n","\n","20エポック、LoRA r=16、alpha=32、学習率2e-4。入力はDriveのdata_20261031フォルダです。\n","\n","4つのデータファイルとREADME.mdの保存を確認し、次回もDriveから読み込みます。結果は実行ごとに別のglossary_lora_e20_日時フォルダに保存します。\n","\n","設定セルを再実行すると保存先が変わるので、学習実行中は再実行しないでください。"]},{"cell_type":"code","execution_count":null,"id":"09c69560","metadata":{"id":"09c69560","colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/"},"executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1793414016766,"user_tz":-540,"elapsed":1670,"user":{"displayName":"松浦健太","userId":"07161653785768738821"}},"outputId":"95147c62-2111-478a-d4c4-edb325655391"},"outputs":[{"output_type":"stream","name":"stdout","text":["Drive already mounted at /content/drive; to attempt to forcibly remount, call drive.mount(\"/content/drive\", force_remount=True).\n","Drive保存確認: gold.json 28860 bytes\n","Drive保存確認: test.jsonl 7843 bytes\n","Drive保存確認: train.jsonl 215155 bytes\n","Drive保存確認: valid.jsonl 27071 bytes\n","Drive保存確認: README.md 5385 bytes\n","{\n","  \"base_model\": \"Qwen/Qwen3.5-0.8B\",\n","  \"revision\": \"2fc06364715b967f1860aea9cf38778875588b17\",\n","  \"seed\": 42,\n","  \"num_train_epochs\": 20,\n","  \"warmup_steps\": 6,\n","  \"lr\": 0.0002,\n","  \"lora_r\": 16,\n","  \"lora_alpha\": 32,\n","  \"max_seq_len\": 512,\n","  \"max_new_tokens\": 256,\n","  \"gen\": {\n","    \"do_sample\": false\n","  },\n","  \"data_dir\": \"/content/drive/MyDrive/aie2026/glossary_lora/data_20261031\",\n","  \"work_dir\": \"/content/glossary_lora_e20_20261031_023336\",\n","  \"drive_dir\": \"/content/drive/MyDrive/aie2026/glossary_lora/runs\"\n","}\n"]}],"source":["from pathlib import Path\n","import os, json, time, shutil, hashlib\n","from google.colab import drive\n","drive.mount('/content/drive')\n","ROOT = Path('/content/drive/MyDrive/aie2026/glossary_lora')\n","DATA = ROOT / 'data_20261031'\n","DATA.mkdir(parents=True, exist_ok=True)\n","UPLOAD_NAMES = ['gold.json', 'test.jsonl', 'train.jsonl', 'valid.jsonl', 'README.md']\n","for name in UPLOAD_NAMES:\n","    src, dst = Path('/content') / name, DATA / name\n","    if src.is_file():\n","        if dst.exists():\n","            assert src.read_bytes() == dst.read_bytes(), f'既存ファイルと内容が異なります: {dst}'\n","        else:\n","            shutil.copy2(src, dst)\n","        assert hashlib.sha256(src.read_bytes()).digest() == hashlib.sha256(dst.read_bytes()).digest()\n","    assert dst.is_file(), f'未保存のファイルです: {name}'\n","    print('Drive保存確認:', name, dst.stat().st_size, 'bytes')\n","# すでに完了した学習前評価も退避する。\n","previous_work = Path('/content/glossary_lora_20261031_014227')\n","if previous_work.is_dir():\n","    shutil.copytree(previous_work, ROOT / 'runs' / previous_work.name, dirs_exist_ok=True)\n","CONFIG = {\n","    'base_model': 'Qwen/Qwen3.5-0.8B',\n","    'revision': '2fc06364715b967f1860aea9cf38778875588b17',\n","    'seed': 42, 'num_train_epochs': 20, 'warmup_steps': 6,\n","    'lr': 2e-4, 'lora_r': 16, 'lora_alpha': 32,\n","    'max_seq_len': 512, 'max_new_tokens': 256,\n","    'gen': {'do_sample': False},\n","    'data_dir': str(DATA),\n","    'work_dir': '/content/glossary_lora_e20_' + time.strftime('%Y%m%d_%H%M%S'),\n","    'drive_dir': str(ROOT / 'runs'),\n","}\n","WORK = Path(CONFIG['work_dir']); WORK.mkdir(parents=True, exist_ok=True)\n","USE_DRIVE = True\n","Path(CONFIG['drive_dir']).mkdir(parents=True, exist_ok=True)\n","print(json.dumps(CONFIG, ensure_ascii=False, indent=2))"]},{"cell_type":"code","source":["from google.colab import drive\n","drive.mount('/content/drive')"],"metadata":{"colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/","height":313},"id":"txn5ixUxtvQr","executionInfo":{"status":"error","timestamp":1793412649429,"user_tz":-540,"elapsed":15334,"user":{"displayName":"松浦健太","userId":"07161653785768738821"}},"outputId":"94d7ad43-335b-47c7-dbb7-b912970698c3"},"id":"txn5ixUxtvQr","execution_count":null,"outputs":[{"output_type":"error","ename":"MessageError","evalue":"Error: credential propagation was unsuccessful","traceback":["\u001b[0;31m---------------------------------------------------------------------------\u001b[0m","\u001b[0;31mMessageError\u001b[0m                              Traceback (most recent call last)","\u001b[0;32m/tmp/ipykernel_3207/1408506528.py\u001b[0m in \u001b[0;36m<cell line: 0>\u001b[0;34m()\u001b[0m\n\u001b[1;32m      1\u001b[0m \u001b[0;32mfrom\u001b[0m \u001b[0mgoogle\u001b[0m\u001b[0;34m.\u001b[0m\u001b[0mcolab\u001b[0m \u001b[0;32mimport\u001b[0m \u001b[0mdrive\u001b[0m\u001b[0;34m\u001b[0m\u001b[0;34m\u001b[0m\u001b[0m\n\u001b[0;32m----> 2\u001b[0;31m \u001b[0mdrive\u001b[0m\u001b[0;34m.\u001b[0m\u001b[0mmount\u001b[0m\u001b[0;34m(\u